  "explained": {
    "combowith9518options": "Sample Metadata key catalogue: the native choice lists 9519 keys (the catalogue plus the free-text entry); same catalogue, filterable by typing. Parity.",
    "currentstate—": "Lifecycle before Load: the native capture loads sample_gui first, so it records 'Current state: measured'; the same info line shows '—' before a load. Parity (state-dependent text).",
    "double-clickanyrowtojumptothematchingdockandselecttheitem.": "All items hint: renamed 'Double-click any row to jump to the matching panel and select the item.' (the native app has panels, not docks).",
    "embedded|userdb/var/folders/cl/txwq_hq52rl_t0f9xjk3g5c00000gn/t/mmfdb_admin_qt_kqh76pbg/mmfdb.db|schema50|samples5|experiments5": "Status-bar database line: the native status bar shows the same line (model.database_summary) when the open panel has none; the text differs only by the temporary database path of the run.",
    "metadataid10-donor-gui": "Find Duplicates metadata pane: the native pane prints 'ID 10 - Donor-GUI' with the category / maxima / QY lines under it (the 'Metadata' heading is not repeated per probe). Same data.",
    "metadataid8-donorgui": "As above: 'ID 8 - Donor GUI'.",
    "next▶": "Status bar: 'Next' (the arrow glyph is dropped; 'Back' likewise). Parity.",
    "potentialduplicatesidentifiedbynamesimilarity.selecttheprimaryprobeforeachgroupinthetreebelow.usethepanelontherighttocomparespectrafortheselectedgroup.whenyoumerge,theprimaryprobekeepsitsspectraandmissingonesarefilledfromduplicates.overlapsareignored.": "Find Duplicates explanation: the same sentence, wrapped over three lines by the native info section, so it is recorded as three strings. Parity.",
    "setup_gui—guisetup": "Setup channel panels (Detector Channels, PIE Windows, FCS Pairs): the registry marks these entities read-only (writable=False); Qt nevertheless drew an editable FK combo labelled 'setup_gui — GUI Setup' whose edits the server refused. Native shows the field read-only ('setup_gui') and the table cell as a link that opens the setup (double-click). Deliberate fix."
  },
